# The Setting Sun (sandoria 72): Vamorcote in Northern San d'Oria. Fame 325 (level 5) without Blackmail (only that
# operand fails): his default 651. Blackmail's Dauperiat (fame 5, rank 1) plays 641, which sets needToZone: available
# with needToZone (check 3's status operand fails): 651. Blackmail completed by GM, fame 324 (level 4, only the fame
# operand fails): 651; fame 325: 654 (options [1], [2] the Engraved Key) declined; a key while available (check 1
# holds; no trade handler, no script: nothing); 654 taken (begun). Accepted: 655 (option [2] the key); a chip (nil), the
# key and a chip (not exactly: nil), the key (658: completed, 10000 gil, fame +50, the key taken, needToZone set).
# Completed with needToZone: 659 (replaceDefault); after a rezone: his default 651.
# Vamorcote has no script; his default is 651. Dauperiat has no script. The Engraved Key comes from outside this quest
# (by GM here).
lists NorthernSanDoria/Vamorcote/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/Vamorcote/onTrade NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/654 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/658
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=-135.57,11.999,161.855 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
fame Sandoria 325
item EngravedKey
item BoneChip
login
trigger Vamorcote                         # Blackmail not completed: not offered; his default 651
finish
trigger Dauperiat                         # Blackmail, fame level 5, rank 1: 641
finish                                    # needToZone set
trigger Vamorcote                         # available, needToZone: check 3 is completed only; 651
finish
rezone                                    # needToZone cleared
quest Sandoria.Blackmail completed
fame Sandoria 324
trigger Vamorcote                         # fame level 4: 651
finish
fame Sandoria 325
trigger Vamorcote                         # fame level 5, Blackmail completed: 654
finish                                    # option 0: nothing
trade Vamorcote EngravedKey x1            # available (check 1 holds): no trade handler, no script: nothing
trigger Vamorcote                         # 654
finish option=1                           # begun
trigger Vamorcote                         # accepted: 655
finish
trade Vamorcote BoneChip x1               # not the key: nil
trade Vamorcote EngravedKey x1 BoneChip x1   # not exactly the key: nil
trade Vamorcote EngravedKey x1            # 658
finish                                    # completed: 10000 gil, fame +50; the key taken; needToZone
trigger Vamorcote                         # completed, needToZone: 659 (replaceDefault)
finish
rezone                                    # needToZone cleared
trigger Vamorcote                         # completed, no needToZone: no section; 651
finish
